     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Dear 宗雄,<div><br></div><div>可使用 nrow 與 dim函數.<br><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><div>nrow(data)</div><div>dim(data)[1]<br># end</div></div></code></div><br>宗雄陳於 2017年3月20日星期一 UTC+8上午9時52分40秒寫道：<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi, 各位先進<div><br></div><div>本人在學習R的過程中發現一現象：</div><div>當資料列被刪除後，其index不會重整，這造成若以tail來抓出最後一筆資料判斷資料筆數會有誤判。</div><div><br></div><div>例：</div><div><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,&quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.25;color:rgb(255,255,255);background-color:rgb(0,34,64);white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,157,0)\">data &lt;- data.frame(x1=c(1:10),x2=sample(0:100,10,replace=FALSE)</span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,&quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.25;color:rgb(255,255,255);background-color:rgb(0,34,64);white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,157,0)\">data\r\n</span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,&quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.25;color:rgb(255,255,255);background-color:rgb(0,34,64);white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,157,0)\"><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,&quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.25;color:rgb(255,255,255);white-space:pre-wrap!important\">   x1 x2</pre><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,&quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.25;color:rgb(255,255,255);white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,&quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.25;white-space:pre-wrap!important\">1   1 75</pre><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,&quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.25;white-space:pre-wrap!important\">2   2 72\r\n3   3 39\r\n4   4 98\r\n5   5 21\r\n6   6 28\r\n7   7 26\r\n8   8  4\r\n9   9  6\r\n10 10 22</pre><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,&quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.25;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><br></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,&quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.25;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,157,0);white-space:pre\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,157,0)\">data &lt;- data[-9,]\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,157,0);white-space:pre\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,157,0)\">data\r\n</span>   x1 x2\r\n1   1 75\r\n2   2 72\r\n3   3 39\r\n4   4 98\r\n5   5 21\r\n6   6 28\r\n7   7 26\r\n8   8  4\r\n10 10 22</pre><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,&quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.25;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><br></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,&quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border-width:initial;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.25;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">如上，最後一筆的index仍為10.</div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">請問各位先進，在開發過程中都沒有造成困擾嗎？或是有什方式可以取得資料筆數</div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">Ps. 若用summary/table/lengths , 這三個指令，目前則用lengths判斷</div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br></div></pre></pre></span></pre></div></div></blockquote></div></div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
